{"record": "turn", "turn": 3, "seconds": 4.778, "response_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_details": null, "blocks": ["thinking", "tool_use"], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 22718}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 22718, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3569, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 552, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 116}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}, "tools": [{"id": "toolu_012cRVJkSY1f2f9ErMgYRKgu", "name": "submit_answer", "arguments": {"answer": "In Kim, Lee, Park and Shin (arXiv:1601.05089), the ψψ̄ → h2 → h2h2 best fit has m_ψ = 69.2 GeV and m_h2 = 35.7 GeV. They give ⟨σv⟩ = 2.26×10⁻²⁶ cm³ s⁻¹ with Ωh² = 0.121. The canonical J-factor is rescaled by 𝒥 = 2.2, so J̄ = 2.2 × J̄_canonical. The fit has χ² = 23.19 and p-value 0.39.\n\nI read this as the dedicated h2h2 channel. The paper also has a mass-degenerate case (m_ψ = 127.5 GeV, m_h2 = 125.7 GeV) in which h2h2 is the largest channel at 88.2%. I did not use that case.", "found": true, "evidence": [{"arxiv_id": "1601.05089v3", "section_id": "3.4"}, {"arxiv_id": "1601.05089v3", "section_id": "3"}]}, "status": "answer", "error_kind": null, "seconds": 0.0}]}
{"record": "end", "run_id": "20261120T065949Z_dev-03_flat_1e12", "reason": "answered", "detail": "", "answer": {"answer": "In Kim, Lee, Park and Shin (arXiv:1601.05089), the ψψ̄ → h2 → h2h2 best fit has m_ψ = 69.2 GeV and m_h2 = 35.7 GeV. They give ⟨σv⟩ = 2.26×10⁻²⁶ cm³ s⁻¹ with Ωh² = 0.121. The canonical J-factor is rescaled by 𝒥 = 2.2, so J̄ = 2.2 × J̄_canonical. The fit has χ² = 23.19 and p-value 0.39.\n\nI read this as the dedicated h2h2 channel. The paper also has a mass-degenerate case (m_ψ = 127.5 GeV, m_h2 = 125.7 GeV) in which h2h2 is the largest channel at 88.2%. I did not use that case.", "found": true, "evidence": [{"arxiv_id": "1601.05089v3", "section_id": "3.4"}, {"arxiv_id": "1601.05089v3", "section_id": "3"}]}, "turns": 3, "seconds": 10.156, "tool_calls": 2, "tool_result_chars": 51264, "input_tokens": 8, "output_tokens": 782, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 24142, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7859, "parser_versions": ["4"], "response_models": ["claude-sonnet-5-5"], "ended_at": "2026-11-20T07:00:00+00:00"}
